<h2>Homepage Layout</h2>

<p>
    The Homepage Layout section lets you customize what appears on your homepage and how it's displayed. You can control each widget individually.
</p>

<p>
    For each widget (like Proposals, Certificate Requests, Leads, etc.), you can set:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Visibility</strong> – Visible, Collapsed, or Hidden
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Visible</strong> – Widget shows fully expanded</li>
            <li><strong>Collapsed</strong> – Widget shows but starts minimized (you can expand it)</li>
            <li><strong>Hidden</strong> – Widget doesn't appear at all</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li><strong>Display Count</strong> – How many items to show (0-100)
        <ul>
            <li>For example, "Display 10 most recent proposals"</li>
            <li>Set to 0 to hide the widget even if visibility is set to Visible</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
</ul>

<p>
    This lets you create a homepage that shows exactly what you need to see, in the way that works best for your workflow.
</p>

