<h3>Available Homepage Widgets</h3>

<p>
    You can customize these widgets:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Proposals</strong> - Recent proposals and proposal pipeline</li>
    <li><strong>Certificate Requests</strong> - Certificate requests that need attention</li>
    <li><strong>Leads</strong> - Recent leads and lead activity</li>
    <li><strong>Daily Task List</strong> - Your personal task list</li>
    <li><strong>Renewal Flow Tasks</strong> - Tasks from renewals</li>
    <li><strong>Expiring Soon</strong> - Policies expiring in the near future</li>
    <li><strong>Incomplete Tasks</strong> – Tasks that need attention</li>
    <li><strong>Daily Inspiration</strong> – Verses, quotes, or motivational content</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Each widget can be independently configured to match your preferences.
</p>

<!-- IMAGE PLACEHOLDER: Screenshot showing multiple widgets in the Homepage Layout list, or a visual representation of all available widgets. Use icons or small previews to identify each widget type. -->

<h2>Daily Inspiration</h2>

<p>
    The Daily Inspiration widget shows verses, quotes, or other motivational content on your homepage. You can:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Choose the type</strong> – Select verses, quotes, or other content types</li>
    <li><strong>Hide it completely</strong> – Set it to Hidden if you don't want to see it</li>
    <li><strong>Change it anytime</strong> – Update your preference whenever you want</li>
</ul>

<p>
    This is completely optional—customize it to your preference or hide it if you prefer to focus purely on work items.
</p>

