<h2>How Settings Work</h2>

<p>
    <strong>Saving settings:</strong>
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Most settings save automatically when you change them</li>
    <li>Some settings (like password) require clicking a Save button</li>
    <li>Changes take effect immediately (no page refresh needed)</li>
</ul>

<p>
    <strong>Settings are personal:</strong>
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Your settings only affect your view of Quickfire</li>
    <li>Other users have their own independent settings</li>
    <li>You can change settings anytime without affecting others</li>
</ul>

