<h2>Tips for Customizing</h2>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Start with defaults</strong> – Try the default settings first, then adjust what doesn't work for you</li>
    <li><strong>Hide unused widgets</strong> – If you don't use a widget, hide it to reduce clutter</li>
    <li><strong>Use collapsed state</strong> – Collapse widgets you check occasionally but don't need always visible</li>
    <li><strong>Adjust display counts</strong> – Set counts that match how many items you actually review</li>
    <li><strong>Experiment</strong> – Change settings and see how they feel—you can always change them back</li>
    <li><strong>Update regularly</strong> – As your workflow changes, update your settings to match</li>
</ul>

