<h2>Common Settings Combinations</h2>

<p>
    Here are some example setups you might try:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Minimal homepage</strong> – Hide most widgets, keep only Daily Tasks and Renewal Flow Tasks visible</li>
    <li><strong>High-volume focus</strong> – Show Proposals, Certificates, and Payments with high display counts</li>
    <li><strong>Quiet workspace</strong> – Turn off Audio and Spicy Visuals, enable Safety's On</li>
    <li><strong>Full dashboard</strong> – Keep all widgets visible with moderate display counts</li>
</ul>

<p>
    There's no right or wrong way—set it up however works best for you.
</p>

